\subsection{Method \code{run()}}{
Run the Metropolis-within-Gibbs sampler.

Each iteration performs in order: (1) conjugate update of emission
parameters, (2) Gibbs update of the latent field, (3) MH update of
\code{theta} using the newly sampled field. Samples are appended to any
previously collected samples.
\subsection{Usage}{
\if{html}{\out{<div class="r">}}\preformatted{HMRFPseudoBayes$run(nsamples, verbose = interactive())}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}
}

\subsection{Arguments}{
\if{html}{\out{<div class="arguments">}}
\describe{
\item{\code{nsamples}}{Number of iterations to run.}

\item{\code{verbose}}{If \code{TRUE}, prints iteration progress to the console.}
}
\if{html}{\out{</div>}}
}
\subsection{Returns}{
The sampler itself, invisibly (allows chaining).
}
